==Trivia==
This card is one of several featured in the {{TCGP|Genetic Apex}} expansion's "Safari Zone" [[Genetic Apex (TCG Pocket)#Themed Collections|Themed Collection]], all of which can be found in the [[Kanto Safari Zone]] in Generations {{gen|I}} and {{gen|III}}.

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Garura Parent/Child|Kangaskhan|promo}}, an {{TCG|Unnumbered Promotional cards|unnumbered promotional card}} only released in Japan.
**Both cards have the {{m|Dizzy Punch}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Kangaskhan}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

